  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37704292",
      "title": "Using the \"Ask Before Answer\" Technique",
      "sourceHash": "12a2957224473103f92a06affa317e471b9ce842ad66464f21f6f355de208aec",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 4.88,
          "en": "Before I actually move ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.88,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "to the developer focused example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 9.75,
          "en": "where you do need some programming experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.75,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "I wanna come back to this Monster Slayer game,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 14.43,
          "en": "and I wanna highlight something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.43,
          "end": 16.83,
          "en": "In the prompts I used here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.83,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "I used fairly basic prompting techniques.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "I defined a role and a goal and provided extra context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 28.05,
          "en": "because these are the core building blocks of all prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.05,
          "end": 30.06,
          "en": "And of course, we then refined the game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.06,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "and fixed errors step by step by sending follow-up messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "which were simpler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 39.21,
          "en": "because ChatGPT keeps all the existing context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.21,
          "end": 41.1,
          "en": "So follow-up messages don't need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 43.02,
          "en": "to start from scratch again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.02,
          "end": 45.461,
          "en": "But of course, you can also add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.461,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "other prompting techniques here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 50.64,
          "en": "For example, I could also build this game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.64,
          "end": 52.62,
          "en": "by using this initial prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 56.13,
          "en": "and then starting a new chat where I sent that same prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.13,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "But before sending that prompt, I'll tweak it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 60.752,
          "en": "And I'll also say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.752,
          "end": 65.752,
          "en": "before providing the code, ask any questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 72.08,
          "en": "that allow you to provide a better response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.57,
          "end": 76.17,
          "en": "So I'm using the ask before answer technique here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.17,
          "end": 81.17,
          "en": "to get ChatGPT to ask any additional questions it needs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "so to ask for any additional information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "it needs to provide a better response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 91.691,
          "en": "And that's of course also technique we could use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.691,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "I did not use it before, but we could use it to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 97.53,
          "en": "potentially get a better result quicker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "So for example here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 101.97,
          "en": "it asks me which programming language it should use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.97,
          "end": 104.4,
          "en": "And of course you might be getting different questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 106.38,
          "en": "as you know, but it's asking me for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.38,
          "end": 107.97,
          "en": "the programming language,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.97,
          "end": 110.34,
          "en": "if it should have a graphical user interface,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.34,
          "end": 114.36,
          "en": "or if it should be a terminal based game and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.36,
          "end": 116.55,
          "en": "Now it turns out that before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.55,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "it did actually pick good defaults for these questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "So before, when I did not tell it to ask me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 125.52,
          "en": "before providing a response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.52,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "and it therefore gave me a fitting response right away.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 131.49,
          "en": "But using this ask before answer technique here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.49,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "can of course make sure that you're avoiding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 135.54,
          "en": "unnecessary feedback loops",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.54,
          "end": 139.38,
          "en": "and you are avoiding unnecessary follow-up messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.38,
          "end": 142.14,
          "en": "by getting a better response initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 144.75,
          "en": "And I just wanted to highlight this again here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.75,
          "end": 147.84,
          "en": "just because I did not use certain prompting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.84,
          "end": 150.12,
          "en": "techniques covered earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.12,
          "end": 153.48,
          "en": "does not mean that they're wrong to use here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.48,
          "end": 157.17000000000002,
          "en": "or that you couldn't maybe achieve a better result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "by using them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.35,
          "en": "Instead, I just showed you one possible solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.35,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "Of course, there are different ways of getting there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 168.69,
          "en": "And for example, using this ask before answer technique here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.69,
          "end": 170.793,
          "en": "would've also been a good idea.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
